(23, 1936, 'Additional information required to support MA application', 1527, '2024-10-27 07:23:54', 1),
(24, 2009, 'Administrative Information \r\n\r\n1.	You are requested to provide name and contact details of your Local Technical Representative and submit Letter of appointment supported by original copy of power of attorney duly notarized in country of origin, and registered with registrar of Companies in Rwanda.  \r\n\r\n2.	Please note that the submitted PIL for DEXONA was acknowledged. However, it is not in line with guidance on format and content of PIL. Kindly submit the PIL and ensure compliance with our regulatory requirements and provide the product information in line with guidance on format and content of PIL available on Rwanda FDA website. https://rwandafda.gov.rw/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Guidance-on-Format-and-Content-of-Patient-Information-Leaflets-for-human-medicinal-Products.pdf\r\n         Please ensure to follow the format and include the information as:\r\na.	What (product name) is and what it is used for,\r\nb.	Before you <take><use> (product name)\r\nc.	How to<take>><use> (product name)\r\nd.	Possible side effects\r\ne.	How to store (product name)\r\nf.	Further information\r\n\r\nActive Pharmaceutical Ingredient (API)\r\n1.	Please note that information on particle size distribution and polymorphism of DEXAMETHASONE was not discussed. In addition, quantitative solubility data from API manufacturer was not discussed. Kindly provide information on particle size distribution and polymorphism of DEXAMETHASONE. In addition, provide solubility data in mg/mL for your API in 250mL water at pH 1.2, 4.5, and 6.8 performed at 37ºC. The dose solubility volume (DSV) calculations to illustrate the BCS class to which this API belongs should also be provided.\r\n\r\n2.	You are requested to submit the copies of the IR spectrum of dexamethasone from Mahima Life Sciences Pvt.Ltd run concomitantly with a pharmacopoeial reference standard\r\n\r\nFinished Pharmaceutical Products (FPP)\r\n1.	Please note that the Bioequivalence report was not traced in submitted product dossier while     Dexona (Dexamethasone tablet BP 0.5mg) is a generic product with Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient (Dexamethasone) classified as BCS Class II (low solubility and high Permeability).  Therefore, you are required to submit bioequivalence report between your product Dexona (Dexamethasone tablet BP 0.5mg) and Comparator/Innovator product. Additionally, the duly-filled in bioequivalence trial information form (BTIF) in Microsoft Word file format should be submitted along with the requested BE report.\r\n\r\n2.	Magnesium Stearate was used as excipient. You are requested to submit signed and dated declaration that Magnesium stearate is free from TSE/BSE causative agents.  \r\n\r\n3.	Please note that the submitted copies on specifications of Dexamethasone Tablets BP 0.5 mg are acknowledged. However, the provided specifications are not indicated if they are at release or at the end of the shelf -life. You are requested to submit two separate sets of specifications (at release and at the end of shelf-life). Copies should be dated and signed, with reference and version number. \r\n\r\n4.	Please note that your submitted information indicating that Validation of analytical procedures was not applicable as Dexamethasone Tablets BP 0.5 mg is a pharmacopoeial product mentioned in BP was acknowledged. However, Assay and related substances were not verified. You are requested to submit information on verification of assay and related substances for Dexamethasone Tablets BP 0.5 mg.\r\n\r\n5.	The provided information in QOS indicate that the batch analysis was conducted on three consecutive batches (VA728, VA729 and VA730). However, you only submit one certificate of analysis. To check the consistency, kindly provide the certificate of analysis of the remaining two batches (VA729 and VA730).\r\n\r\n6.	Note that the description of the packaging material for Dexamethasone Tablets BP with their specifications was provided. However, Identification test by IR was not included in the specification. Kindly revise and submit specifications having Identification test by IR. \r\n', 838, '2024-10-29 09:52:33', 1),
